This release retains 19 required mathematical modules and a matching
Quantum.lean umbrella import. The unused module and development material
are omitted. Mathlib is pinned to the exact project revision, and the
unused checkdecls tool dependency is omitted.

Four Japanese comments in Quantum/QuantumMechanics/QuantumChannel.lean
are translated into English. All retained mathematical tokens are
unchanged. UPSTREAM_SHA256 records the original supplied sources;
SOURCE_SHA256 records the distributed subset and umbrella import.
